      "content": "it sounds like ur saying its a pretty sure bet. but what about the downsides? like the cost of upgrading the whole grid, or the fact that we don't even have enough lithium/cobalt for all these batteries yet? seems like a huge gamble if the tech or the supply chain fails.",
